{"id": "caltrain-electrification-budget-and-change-order", "title": "Caltrain electrification cost $462 million more than its initial estimate", "seconds": 55.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.008, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "ca3a96c68f589181", "words": 128, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2021 Caltrain reported that electric service would be delayed.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.84, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "changed", "in", "the", "electrification", "budget?"], "sub": "Caltrain"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.61, 0.94, 1.56, 2.16, 2.64, 2.81, 3.26, 3.69, 3.91, 4.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "It cited unforeseen underground conditions and pandemic supply disruptions.", "t0": 4.96, "t1": 8.97, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "delay", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "Underground conditions", "mark": "Underground conditions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.59, 1.18, 1.66, 2.22, 2.35, 2.88, 3.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In December the agency approved a 462 million dollar increase over the initial estimate.", "t0": 9.09, "t1": 15.95, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$462 million", "label": "Increase over the initial budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.68, 0.84, 1.29, 1.8, 1.9, 2.25, 2.82, 3.8, 4.31, 4.65, 5.56, 5.82, 5.96, 6.37]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The revised budget was 2.44 billion dollars.", "t0": 16.07, "t1": 19.49, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "revision", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "Revised budget", "mark": "Revised budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.76, 1.17, 1.38, 1.61, 1.9, 2.21, 2.49, 2.89]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Balfour Beatty sought 21 million dollars for escalation.", "t0": 19.71, "t1": 23.54, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Escalation", "heading": "Demand and settlement", "source": "board", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Balfour Beatty demand", "value": "$21 million"}, {"icon": "decision", "label": "Approved change order", "value": "$13.5 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.56, 1.07, 1.4, 2.03, 2.49, 2.89, 3.05]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Eight board members approved a 13.5 million dollar change order without dissent.", "t0": 23.66, "t1": 29.53, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vote", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "February 6, 2025", "mark": "February 6, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.67, 1.04, 1.59, 1.68, 2.27, 2.62, 3.03, 3.48, 3.82, 4.22, 4.85, 5.32]}, {"scene": "change", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The change order was inside the revised budget.", "t0": 29.65, "t1": 32.46, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Within the revised budget"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.66, 0.93, 1.12, 1.65, 1.78, 2.33]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Electric service began in September 2024.", "t0": 32.68, "t1": 35.75, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "close", "kicker": "Peninsula Corridor Joint Powers Board / Caltrain", "text": "September 2024", "mark": "September 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 0.98, 1.42, 1.55, 2.1, 2.39]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Weekend trains increased from 32 to 66 per day.", "t0": 35.87, "t1": 40.65, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Weekend service"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.98, 1.49, 1.71, 2.78, 3.03, 4.21, 4.41]}, {"scene": "service", "kind": 